      "hasMediaInOriginal": true,
      "fallbackReason": null,
      "text": "Google's new AI created a website worth 3.5 million rubles in just 25 minutes. The model was released a couple of days ago and social media can't stop buzzing about the capabilities of Gemini 3.5 Flash. For instance, one webcoder posted a video showing how he creates a complex web service with 3D animations, particles, and parallax from scratch in just half an hour using the free AI.\n\nPreviously, a team of a designer, a web developer, and a motion graphics specialist would take several weeks to accomplish such a task. Now, it's just one person and a text request in a chat. Experts are confident that a wave of similar projects will hit the market in the coming months, and some web studios and freelancers may struggle to find new clients.",
